                <head>203. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>Ambassador at Large W. Averell Harriman
                    met with General Franco on December 13,
                    1966, in Madrid. Their discussion centered on the situation in Vietnam. The two
                    men also discussed North Africa and the Middle East. A memorandum of their
                    conversation is in the National Archives and Records Administration, RG 59, Central Files 1964-66, POL 7 US/HARRIMAN.</p>
            </div>
